{"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[17],"Id":78,"TextResource":{"Name":"mr-nuts","Translations":[{"Text":"Mr Nuts","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Mr Nuts","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"1","Id":239},{"FloorId":"3","Id":296}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>El maní confitado que nació en Chile y se tomó gran parte del mundo también está presente en el aeropuerto, ahora con más opciones de frutos secos para disfrutar en cualquier momento de uno de los sabores tradicionales de Chile.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>The candied peanuts recipe which originated in Chile and spread to a large part of the world is also available at the airport, now with more dried fruit options so that you can enjoy one of Chile's traditional flavors at any time.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/078_mr-nuts.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/375\/node\/349","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/375\/node\/349","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/078_mr-nuts.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/78\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/078_mr-nuts.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/78\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true}